<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Only pages that belong in search results, on the canonical host.

  These used to be listed as https://www.cricbid.online/..., which 301s to the
  bare host — so every entry pointed at a redirect rather than at the page
  itself. The list must also stay in step with the allowlist in
  frontend/src/components/seo/RouteMeta.tsx: a URL that is noindex has no place
  in a sitemap, and /guide-videos is deliberately absent because it is unlisted.

  The twelve /guides/<slug> clip pages are listed: they are indexable by the
  allowlist and are now pre-rendered, so each is a real page in its own right.
-->
